WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Annual salary of 500,000, dedicated to selling fruits to me

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,800
The other one is that I will provide you with fruit

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,300
You are at your own risk

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,660
I think it will be much better than if you go to work

5
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,260
You are taking revenge

6
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,860
I just laughed at you in the group for selling fruit.

7
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,560
Now you want me to sell fruit

8
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,260
Can you stop being so petty?

9
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:18,860
Nenghan Laobao earns an annual salary of 500,000 yuan

10
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,260
Don't talk about selling fruit

11
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:22,920
It doesn't matter if we sell pork.

12
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,650
So which one do you choose?

13
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:25,950
I want to choose the first one

14
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:27,350
but i want to know

15
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:28,950
What are the working years?

16
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:31,150
Is it okay to have a ten-year contract?

17
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:33,050
Worried about whether it will last long

18
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:34,550
I can make you do it for a lifetime

19
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:36,750
As long as you can still work, keep doing it.

20
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:39,520
Until you apply for retirement yourself

21
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,820
Thank you boss

22
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,020
I'll wait for you to get off work

23
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,520
I'll stay at your place tonight

24
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,120
Because you are running out of money

25
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:46,720
Much better than Hu Kai

26
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:47,720
No

27
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:48,920
How come I don't know

28
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:50,920
You are the HR manager of Tianbao Auction House

29
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:52,320
The future is bright

30
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,420
Wen Yuan and the front desk are the same age.
